{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本連鎖食肆壽司郎位於北京的分店，近日被指有小童在店內用餐區小便，目擊者聲稱當時店員未有制止。店方之後稱，已封閉涉事座位及全面消毒，當地市場監管部門亦介入處理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在周四，北京海淀區的壽司郎分店，有人拍攝到鄰桌的食客，容許小朋友站在座位上小便，並用膠杯接住。拍攝者又指曾要求店員處理，但對方指自己無權制止。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Smhz1nV6LA1788611138.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">該分店之後證實事件，指涉事座位已封閉，並棄置該位置的全部餐具，當地市場監管部門指，已派人到店內處理及消毒。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有內地傳媒評論指，這種行為反映家長缺乏公德心，又指有家長認為帶小朋友就可以自動豁免規則，剝削他人權利，認為應追究家長在公共環境中的責任。另外又批評當時店方不介入處理，是推諉卸責，認為是縱容有關行為。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Jdp3e0eSSV1788611157.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_004.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次並非首次有食客，有壽司郎內地分店做出不文明行為。廣州番禺分店上月中，有小童將雙腳伸到鄰桌，並碰到桌上水龍頭。涉事分店之後要全面消毒，及更換涉事水龍頭。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SUSHIRO 2000_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026WvKeybZR1O1788611490.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.SUSHIRO 2000_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_005.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RLLk3SMQ5s1788611169.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SUSHIRO 1830_005.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T12:39:39.870992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}